# Marathon restaurant repo

Start from `AGENTS.md`. Then open only the source of truth for the area you are changing:

- Frontend: `frontend/restaurant-frontend-app/CLAUDE.md`
- Backend: `backend/restaurant-backend-app/CLAUDE.md`
- Deploy: root `README.md`
- API contract: `backend/restaurant-backend-app/docs/ApiRoutes.md` and `RouteRegistry.cs`

Use project skills in `.cursor/skills/` (`frontend-angular`, `backend-dotnet-lambda`, `deploy-aws`).

Do not commit, branch, or push unless asked. Do not duplicate CLAUDE.md content into new files.
